        <mxCell id="zwVLvU2gcYmJ1tXzipiD-83" value="There feels like there is some relationship with AI and security/privacy&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;I mean yeah there&#39;s national security/stability or something but also modern internet data privacy things. Even though it&#39;s not really effecting anyone, the potential that it could is deeply uncomfortable.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
