        <mxCell id="zwVLvU2gcYmJ1tXzipiD-90" value="DISAMBIGUATION: Not from AI as a whole (ex: don&#39;t care about narrow AI), but from the dominance of a specific training regime or a specific LLM/model.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Something something: We are converging all of our tools and values into a single entity with vast amounts of influence over society. &quot;tool and value collapse/convergence&quot; or something." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
