        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zwVLvU2gcYmJ1tXzipiD-97" value="&lt;b&gt;Personal integration on spectrum&lt;/b&gt;. Some coders can&#39;t live without LLMs, just as we cannot without phones. Any kind of integration (VR, media, direct brain/AI integration, etc.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It&#39;s not safe even for those who want to augment rather than replace humans (but this is also a bad long-term outcome imo)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" vertex="1" parent="1">
