        <mxCell id="zwVLvU2gcYmJ1tXzipiD-100" value="Are metrics of automation bias a thing?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maybe there&#39;s some range of ideals tools can be embedded with. Tools have ideals. There&#39;s only a range of things a tool can be used for and influence it can have.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ex: A useless machine. A machine that flies around and autonomously vaporizes an ethnic group.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Disambiguating these seem important&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Tools aren&#39;t just tools&quot;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
