        <mxCell id="zwVLvU2gcYmJ1tXzipiD-103" value="Feedback Loops&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI R&amp;amp;D -- Same models design a machine and run it. Developing newer models and so on. We kind of lock in our values if we don&#39;t allow humans to edit the AI even once its more powerful than our engineers. We effectively have &quot;one tool&quot; and not multiple." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" vertex="1" parent="1">
